@startuml AD-02-set-availability
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 DiamondBackgroundColor white
 DiamondBorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam wrapWidth 250
skinparam dpi 180
title AD-02: Availability and Job Preference Submission
' Traces: UC-11; FR-13/14/16/17/21/66; NFR-09.
' Sources: DEC-01, DEC-02, DEC-03, DEC-07, DEC-30, DEC-45; INT-ITA [Q: Audit], [Q: Connection failure].
|Staff|
start
:Open Availability and\nJob Preferences (UC-11);
|System|
:Show permitted dates, Slots\nand Availability Deadline;
if (Week locked?) then (yes)
  :Refuse direct changes;\noffer late-change request (UC-12);
  |Staff|
  if (Submit Late Availability\nChange Request?) then (yes)
    :Submit changed Slots\nwith reason (UC-12);
    |Manager|
    :Approve or reject request\nthrough UC-09;
    |System|
    :Record decision; apply only approved\nchanges; notify Staff (UC-15);
  else (no)
  endif
  stop
else (no)
endif
|Staff|
repeat
:Set Available / Unavailable\nper Slot; optionally add preferences;
:Review and submit;
|System|
:Validate dates and values;\nrecheck Deadline at save;
if (Valid and still open?) then (yes)
  :Save Availability and preferences;\naudit and confirm only on success;
else (no)
  :Show error; retain records;\nif locked, direct to UC-12;
endif
|Staff|
repeat while (Correct / edit and resubmit?) is (yes) not (no)
stop
legend bottom
Dates: today through the same date next month, inclusive and month-end clamped.
Morning / Afternoon; whole-day shortcut; blank = Not submitted = unavailable.
Locks Wednesday 18:00, 12 days before the week. Late requests cannot change preferences.
Failed saves: up to 3 retries, then advise retry / contact IT Administrator.
endlegend

@enduml
